n- second_level_constructor_additional_registration.md: 二级建造师增项注册办事指南 > 申请材料\n\n请用清晰、可操作的语言回答。	根据当前检索到的业务资料，未查到关于“建筑师证”（即注册建筑师）的材料要求信息。您提到的“建筑师证”，通常指**注册建筑师**（分为一级、二级），但现有证据仅包含二级结构工程师、二级建造师的相关指南，不涉及注册建筑师的申请材料。\n\n建议您：\n- 确认所需证书具体名称：是“注册建筑师”（由住建部和人社部组织实施），还是其他类似名称的培训合格证、职称证书等；\n- 访问【全国注册建筑师管理委员会官网】或【安徽省住房和城乡建设厅官网】“执业注册”专栏，查询最新《注册建筑师初始注册办事指南》；\n- 或拨打安徽省住建厅执业资格注册中心电话（0551-62871509）进行人工咨询。\n\n注：本回复仅基于可验证的检索证据，不构成政策解读或审核承诺。	[{"data": {"has_apply_context": false}, "event": "context_built"}, {"data": {"biz_type": "residence_permit", "normalized_query": "办理建筑师证需要哪些材料"}, "event": "query_preprocessed"}, {"data": {"route": "knowledge_only", "intent": "material_requirements", "reason": "Generic material query for architect certificate, unrelated to current residence_permit ticket or any real application s", "entities": {"biz_type": "residence_permit", "region_code": "340000", "router_provider": "llm"}, "confidence": 0.95, "risk_level": "pass", "sub_intent": "material_requirements", "requires_ticket_context": false, "can_answer_from_knowledge": true}, "event": "intent"}, {"data": {}, "event": "knowledge_filter"}, {"data": {"cache": {"hit": false, "backend": "redis"}, "query": "办理建筑师证需要哪些材料", "filter": {}, "channels": {"rrf": 24, "bm25": 12, "dense": 12, "rerank": 4}, "vector_backend": "milvus", "candidate_count": 248, "rerank_provider": "http", "metadata_coverage": {"missing": [], "present": [], "coverage": 1.0, "required": []}, "embedding_provider": "openai", "metadata_filtering": false, "prefilter_child_count": 248}, "event": "rag_status"}, {"data": {"ok": true, "checks": {"chain": "knowledge_retrieval", "top_score": 0.5987, "rerank_score": 0.5987, "metadata_coverage": {"missing": [], "present": [], "coverage": 1.0, "required": []}, "business_payload_present": false}, "reason": "", "top_score": 0.5987, "source_count": 4, "missing_metadata": [], "required_metadata": []}, "event": "evidence"}, {"data": {"intent": "material_requirements"}, "event": "answer_generated"}, {"data": {