92	2	\N	doc-7bf92d3465b586886b30c83d35453ce8:h:17:p:0	parent	0	二级建造师增项注册办事指南 > 常见问题 > Q2: 二级建造师的继续教育学时应满足什么要求？ 注册一个专业的建造师在每一注册有效期（3年）内应参加继续教育不少于120学时。注册两个及以上专业的，每增加一个专业还应参加所增加专业60学时的继续教育。	baa40f021042cb6275c421ec3ae071f2cd37984acea1fc4b546614e9e14fdc53	0	vec:doc-7bf92d3465b586886b30c83d35453ce8:h:17:p:0		https://www.ahzwfw.gov.cn/bog-bsdt/static/workProcess/components/applicationMaterial.html?ssqdId=4028e69d9d0bb505019d1d88823f3ff8&ssqdCode=d0ed2819903f40f6874d6cdb25ff2988&typeSipe=nameSkip		published	{"ssqd_id": "4028e69d9d0bb505019d1d88823f3ff8", "item_code": "11340000MB0T3248X7200011705500202", "item_name": "二级建造师增项注册", "item_type": "行政许可", "ssqd_code": "d0ed2819903f40f6874d6cdb25ff2988", "audit_node": "", "basic_code": "000117055002", "doc_status": "published", "region_key": "340000000000", "version_no": 1, "agency_name": "安徽省住房和城乡建设厅", "region_code": "340000", "region_name": "安徽省", "catalog_name": "建造师注册资格认定", "heading_path": "二级建造师增项注册办事指南 > 常见问题 > Q2: 二级建造师的继续教育学时应满足什么要求？", "heading_level": 3, "section_index": 17, "policy_version": "2025", "service_object": "自然人", "source_version": "ahzwfw-2026-06-15", "rollout_percent": 100, "chunking_strategy": "hierarchical", "version_group_uid": "doc-7bf92d3465b586886b30c83d35453ce8", "official_source_url": "https://www.ahzwfw.gov.cn/bog-bsdt/static/workProcess/components/applicationMaterial.html?ssqdId=4028e69d9d0bb505019d1d88823f3ff8&ssqdCode=d0ed2819903f40f6874d6cdb25ff2988&typeSipe=nameSkip", "parent_window_index": 0, "catalog_subitem_name": "二级建造师执业资格认定"}	2026-06-15 13:48:51.87058+00	2026-06-15 13:48:51.87058+00
