354	8	\N	doc-19a40c45631b8a3d9d114f43090b6fb6:h:16:p:0	parent	0	二级造价工程师初始注册办事指南 > 常见问题 > Q1: 外省考试通过的二级造价工程师资格证书是否可以在安徽注册？ 根据《造价工程师职业资格制度规定》（建人〔2018〕67号）第十五条：“……二级造价工程师职业资格证书，原则上在所在行政区域内有效……”，外省考试通过的二级造价工程师资格证书目前不能在安徽注册。	167572fae8b43f2798f8ad28b9cf0f892b78714fa06da20f9ca7bc05de216d4f	0	vec:doc-19a40c45631b8a3d9d114f43090b6fb6:h:16:p:0		https://www.ahzwfw.gov.cn/bog-bsdt/static/workProcess/components/applicationMaterial.html?ssqdId=4028e6a6986546ad019872ffb2a204a6&ssqdCode=2c227bd7b7914a5983750fe066f0a49f&typeSipe=nameSkip		published	{"ssqd_id": "4028e6a6986546ad019872ffb2a204a6", "item_code": "11340000MB0T3248X7200011705600002", "item_name": "二级造价工程师初始注册", "item_type": "行政许可", "ssqd_code": "2c227bd7b7914a5983750fe066f0a49f", "audit_node": "", "basic_code": "000117056000", "doc_status": "published", "region_key": "340000000000", "version_no": 1, "agency_name": "安徽省住房和城乡建设厅", "region_code": "340000", "region_name": "安徽省", "catalog_name": "二级造价工程师执业资格认定", "heading_path": "二级造价工程师初始注册办事指南 > 常见问题 > Q1: 外省考试通过的二级造价工程师资格证书是否可以在安徽注册？", "heading_level": 3, "section_index": 16, "policy_version": "2025", "service_object": "自然人", "source_version": "ahzwfw-2026-06-15", "rollout_percent": 100, "chunking_strategy": "hierarchical", "version_group_uid": "doc-19a40c45631b8a3d9d114f43090b6fb6", "official_source_url": "https://www.ahzwfw.gov.cn/bog-bsdt/static/workProcess/components/applicationMaterial.html?ssqdId=4028e6a6986546ad019872ffb2a204a6&ssqdCode=2c227bd7b7914a5983750fe066f0a49f&typeSipe=nameSkip", "parent_window_index": 0, "catalog_subitem_name": "无"}	2026-06-15 13:54:05.429335+00	2026-06-15 13:54:05.429335+00
358	8	\N	doc-19a40c45631b8a3d9d114f43090b6fb6:h:18:p:0	parent	0	二级造价工程师初始注册办事指南 > 常见问题 > Q3: 注册二级造价工程师证书如何发放？ 省住房和城乡建设厅自公告发布之日起5日后，向准予注册的申请人核发《中华人民共和国二级造价工程师注册证书》（电子证书）（以下简称“电子注册证书”），许可日期为电子注册证书签发日期，电子注册证书自签发之日起有效期4年。申请人可以通过注册系统进行查看、下载和打印。	ec061b7d6f3b620ee4f4d5cc69b7a8f7f0c996a7d8eb60e4a0a80539bce2fab4	0	vec:doc-19a40c45631b8a3d9d114f43090b6fb6:h:18:p:0		https://www.ahzwfw.gov.cn/bog-bsdt/static/workProcess/components/applicationMaterial.html?ssqdId=4028e6a6986546ad019872ffb2a204a6&ssqdCode=2c227bd7b7914a5983750fe066f0a49f&typeSipe=nameSkip		published	{"ssqd_id": "4028e6a6986546ad019872ffb2a204a6", "item_code": "11340000MB0T3248X7200011705600002", "item_name": "二级造价工程师初始注册", "item_type": "行政许可", "ssqd_code": "2c227bd7b7914a5983750fe066f0a49f", "audit_node": "", "basic_code": "000117056000", "doc_status": "published", "region_key": "340000000000", "version_no": 1, "agency_name": "安徽省住房和城乡建设厅", "region_code": "340000", "region_name": "安徽省", "catalog_name": "二级造价工程师执业资格认定", "heading_path": "二级造价工程师初始注册办事指南 > 常见问题 > Q3: 注册二级造价工程师证书如何发放？", "heading_level": 3, "section_index": 18, "policy_version": "2025", "service_object": "自然人", "source_version": "ahzwfw-2026-06-15", "rollout_percent": 100, "chunking_strategy": "hierarchical", "version_group_uid": "doc-19a40c45631b8a3d9d114f43090b6fb6", "official_source_url": "https://www.ahzwfw.gov.cn/bog-bsdt/static/workProcess/components/applicationMaterial.html?ssqdId=4028e6a6986546ad019872ffb2a204a6&ssqdCode=2c227bd7b7914a5983750fe066f0a49f&typeSipe=nameSkip", "parent_window_index": 0, "catalog_subitem_name": "无"}	2026-06-15 13:54:05.429335+00	2026-06-15 13:54:05.429335+00
