618	16	616	doc-7a1d2c756f5ad58bf985afbb7ead9ede:p:4:c:1	child	0	的法律知识和专业技能 | | 审查内容 | 无 | ### 流程图 - 涉外收养登记流程图.jpg: https://www.ahzwfw.gov.cn/intranet/group1/M00/16/E8/rBBQHl0VwbCACmSlAAQBzCiKRDU587.jpg?accesskey=4e1abbe7e1e41cfcbbc45675d6dd773d&attrname=%E6%B6%89%E5%A4%96%E6%94%B6%E5%85%BB%E7%99%BB%E8%AE%B0%E6%B5%81%E7%A8%8B%E5%9B%BE.jpg ## 中介服务 无中介服务。 ## 常见问题 ### Q1: 外籍夫妻双方共同收养的，若一方因故无法到场可以办理涉外收养登记么？ 如果一方因故不能来华，应当书面委托另一方。委托书应当经所在国公证和我国驻该国使领馆的认证。 ### Q2: 外国人来华收养子女如何办理收养公证？ 涉外收养公证	c4cbf1cf7e5ec265d3c8e34ff07d1cdb2044003b65582a0b5ce8ff7eb4db1478	0	vec:doc-7a1d2c756f5ad58bf985afbb7ead9ede:p:4:c:1		https://www.ahzwfw.gov.cn/bog-bsdt/static/workProcess/components/applicationMaterial.html?ssqdId=4028e6a19c51d715019ce5ce179b5440&ssqdCode=9d20e5fc68054b75b5b320644d7193b1&typeSipe=nameSkip		published	{"ssqd_id": "4028e6a19c51d715019ce5ce179b5440", "item_code": "11340000002986424J200071100200001", "item_name": "涉外收养登记", "item_type": "行政确认", "ssqd_code": "9d20e5fc68054b75b5b320644d7193b1", "audit_node": "", "basic_code": "000711002000", "doc_status": "published", "region_key": "340000000000", "theme_code": "25", "version_no": 1, "agency_name": "安徽省民政厅", "region_code": "340000", "region_name": "安徽省", "catalog_name": "涉外收养登记", "policy_version": "2025", "service_object": "自然人", "source_version": "ahzwfw-2026-06-15", "rollout_percent": 100, "chunking_strategy": "parent_child", "version_group_uid": "doc-7a1d2c756f5ad58bf985afbb7ead9ede", "official_source_url": "https://www.ahzwfw.gov.cn/bog-bsdt/static/workProcess/components/applicationMaterial.html?ssqdId=4028e6a19c51d715019ce5ce179b5440&ssqdCode=9d20e5fc68054b75b5b320644d7193b1&typeSipe=nameSkip", "catalog_subitem_name": "无"}	2026-06-16 01:10:24.583418+00	2026-06-16 01:10:24.583418+00
619	16	616	doc-7a1d2c756f5ad58bf985afbb7ead9ede:p:4:c:2	child	0	如果一方因故不能来华，应当书面委托另一方。委托书应当经所在国公证和我国驻该国使领馆的认证。 ### Q2: 外国人来华收养子女如何办理收养公证？ 涉外收养公证非法定的强制公证，收养关系当事人各方或者一方要求办理收养公证的，应当到国务院司法行政部门认定的具有办理涉外收养公证资格的公证机构办理收养公证。 ### Q3: 涉外收养的被收养人如何办理出境手续？ 根据《外国人在中华人民共和国收养子女登记办法》，被收养人出境前，收养人应当凭收养登记证书到收养登记地的公安机关为被收养人办理出境手续。获准出境的被收养儿童，在办妥前往国家的签证后，应当在出境前注销户口。 ## 办事评价 | 指标 | 数值 | | --- | --- | | 累计评价数 | 8 | | 综合满意度 | 100.00% | | 评分 | 5.00 | | 非常满意 | 100.00% | | 满意 | 0.00% | | 基本满意 | 0.00% | | 不满意	8f887c2a220a40491e00b295b1cc92608841aab8e79eab0daff7bcda1e581a0c	0	vec:doc-7a1d2c756f5ad58bf985afbb7ead9ede:p:4:c:2		https://www.ahzwfw.gov.cn/bog-bsdt/static/workProcess/components/applicationMaterial.html?ssqdId=4028e6a19c51d715019ce5ce179b5440&ssqdCode=9d20e5fc68054b75b5b320644d7193b1&typeSipe=nameSkip		published	{"ssqd_id": "4028e6a19c51d715019ce5ce179b5440", "item_code": "11340000002986424J200071100200001", "item_name": "涉外收养登记", "item_type": "行政确认", "ssqd_code": "9d20e5fc68054b75b5b320644d7193b1", "audit_node": "", "basic_code": "000711002000", "doc_status": "published", "region_key": "340000000000", "theme_code": "25", "version_no": 1, "agency_name": "安徽省民政厅", "region_code": "340000", "region_name": "安徽省", "catalog_name": "涉外收养登记", "policy_version": "2025", "service_object": "自然人", "source_version": "ahzwfw-2026-06-15", "rollout_percent": 100, "chunking_strategy": "parent_child", "version_group_uid": "doc-7a1d2c756f5ad58bf985afbb7ead9ede", "official_source_url": "https://www.ahzwfw.gov.cn/bog-bsdt/static/workProcess/components/applicationMaterial.html?ssqdId=4028e6a19c51d715019ce5ce179b5440&ssqdCode=9d20e5fc68054b75b5b320644d7193b1&typeSipe=nameSkip", "catalog_subitem_name": "无"}	2026-06-16 01:10:24.583418+00	2026-06-16 01:10:24.583418+00
