816	22	814	doc-9024d6fbab69ef9eed755b7a6691c35d:p:8:c:1	child	0	G8PABGK-S6Wyjs876.png?accesskey=4e1abbe7e1e41cfcbbc45675d6dd773d&attrname=1.png ## 中介服务 ### 1. 建设项目水资源论证 | 字段 | 内容 | | --- | --- | ## 常见问题 ### Q1: 哪些情形不需要办理取水许可？ 下列情形不需要申请领取取水许可证: (一)农村集体经济组织及其成员使用本集体经济组织的水塘、水库中的水的; (二)家庭生活和零星散养、圈养畜禽饮用等少量取水的; (三)为保障矿井等地下工程施工安全和生产安全必须进行临时应急取(排)水的; (四)为消除对公共安全或者公共利益的危害临时应急取水的; (五)为农业抗旱和维护生态与环境必须临时应急取水的。 ### Q2: 取水许可申请准予行政许可决定书失效后，是否需要重新申请取水许可？ 自取水许可申请批准之日起3年内，取水工程或设施未开工建设，取水许可申请准予行政许可决	4305902a87c423a5b301b91e51df358d49a55e058c5523c56a1e111379310ff5	0	vec:doc-9024d6fbab69ef9eed755b7a6691c35d:p:8:c:1		https://www.ahzwfw.gov.cn/bog-bsdt/static/workProcess/components/applicationMaterial.html?ssqdId=4028e69c9dbf51ce019dd4e2a39642a3&ssqdCode=639fe4e84e5244d88a961c6038713b44&typeSipe=nameSkip		published	{"ssqd_id": "4028e69c9dbf51ce019dd4e2a39642a3", "item_code": "11340000002985923L200011900100001", "item_name": "取水许可", "item_type": "行政许可", "ssqd_code": "639fe4e84e5244d88a961c6038713b44", "audit_node": "", "basic_code": "000119001000", "doc_status": "published", "region_key": "340000000000", "theme_code": "42", "version_no": 1, "agency_name": "安徽省水利厅", "region_code": "340000", "region_name": "安徽省", "catalog_name": "取水许可", "policy_version": "2025", "service_object": "自然人,法人", "source_version": "ahzwfw-2026-06-15", "rollout_percent": 100, "chunking_strategy": "parent_child", "version_group_uid": "doc-9024d6fbab69ef9eed755b7a6691c35d", "official_source_url": "https://www.ahzwfw.gov.cn/bog-bsdt/static/workProcess/components/applicationMaterial.html?ssqdId=4028e69c9dbf51ce019dd4e2a39642a3&ssqdCode=639fe4e84e5244d88a961c6038713b44&typeSipe=nameSkip", "catalog_subitem_name": "无"}	2026-06-16 01:11:13.760216+00	2026-06-16 01:11:13.760216+00
817	22	814	doc-9024d6fbab69ef9eed755b7a6691c35d:p:8:c:2	child	0	Q2: 取水许可申请准予行政许可决定书失效后，是否需要重新申请取水许可？ 自取水许可申请批准之日起3年内，取水工程或设施未开工建设，取水许可申请准予行政许可决定书自行失效，取水户需重新申请取水。 ### Q3: 如对取水许可申请准予行政许可决定不服，该如何处理？ 如对取水许可申请准予行政许可决定不服，可在接到本决定书之日起六十日内向水利部申请行政复议，也可以自接到本决定书之日起六个月内向合肥市包河区人民法院起诉，复议、诉讼期间不影响本决定的执行。 ## 办事评价 | 指标 | 数值 | | --- | --- | | 累计评价数 | 114 | | 综合满意度 | 100.00% | | 评分 | 5.00 | | 非常满意 | 100.00% | | 满意 | 0.00% | | 基本满意 | 0.00% | | 不满意 | 0.00% | | 非常不满意 | 0.00% |	d55fb404d1525820e3d4838b614dab807b2194ee716ee8bac11d92c16f8215f4	0	vec:doc-9024d6fbab69ef9eed755b7a6691c35d:p:8:c:2		https://www.ahzwfw.gov.cn/bog-bsdt/static/workProcess/components/applicationMaterial.html?ssqdId=4028e69c9dbf51ce019dd4e2a39642a3&ssqdCode=639fe4e84e5244d88a961c6038713b44&typeSipe=nameSkip		published	{"ssqd_id": "4028e69c9dbf51ce019dd4e2a39642a3", "item_code": "11340000002985923L200011900100001", "item_name": "取水许可", "item_type": "行政许可", "ssqd_code": "639fe4e84e5244d88a961c6038713b44", "audit_node": "", "basic_code": "000119001000", "doc_status": "published", "region_key": "340000000000", "theme_code": "42", "version_no": 1, "agency_name": "安徽省水利厅", "region_code": "340000", "region_name": "安徽省", "catalog_name": "取水许可", "policy_version": "2025", "service_object": "自然人,法人", "source_version": "ahzwfw-2026-06-15", "rollout_percent": 100, "chunking_strategy": "parent_child", "version_group_uid": "doc-9024d6fbab69ef9eed755b7a6691c35d", "official_source_url": "https://www.ahzwfw.gov.cn/bog-bsdt/static/workProcess/components/applicationMaterial.html?ssqdId=4028e69c9dbf51ce019dd4e2a39642a3&ssqdCode=639fe4e84e5244d88a961c6038713b44&typeSipe=nameSkip", "catalog_subitem_name": "无"}	2026-06-16 01:11:13.760216+00	2026-06-16 01:11:13.760216+00
